      "text": "e  Differential hardness between the body and disc seat surfaces is not required."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "f  Case hardness by nitriding to a thickness of 0.13 mm (0.005 in.) minimum."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "g  AWS A5.13 ECoCr-A or AWS A5.21 ERCoCr-A: This classification includes such trademark materials as Stellite 6™ *, Stooky 6™ * and Wallex 6™ *. For Plasma Transfer Arc Welding (PTAW) process powder with the metallurgy equivalent to UNS R30006 can also be used. CoCr-E (Stellite 21™ * or equal) may be used only with purchaser approval and typical CoCr-E alloys include AWS A5.13 ECoCr-E or AWS A5.21 ERCoCr-E."
    },
    {
